***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Grafana admin credentials, seeded by the Grafana Helm chart on first boot.
***REMOVED*** Copy to `grafana-admin.yaml`, fill in. ArgoCD manages it (sync-wave -1 so it
***REMOVED*** exists before Grafana starts).
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp grafana-admin.yaml.example grafana-admin.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR grafana-admin.yaml
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** Values are base64-encoded (this is a `data:` Secret, not `stringData:`):
***REMOVED***   printf 'admin' | base64     -> admin-user
***REMOVED***   printf 's3cr3t' | base64    -> admin-password
***REMOVED*** `ldap-toml` is left empty; set it only if you wire up LDAP auth.
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
    annotations:
        argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: "-1"
    labels:
        app.kubernetes.io/component: admin-secret
        app.kubernetes.io/instance: grafana
        app.kubernetes.io/name: grafana
    name: grafana-admin
    namespace: observability
type: Opaque
data:
    admin-user: REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_USERNAME
    admin-password: REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_PASSWORD
    ldap-toml: ""
